  "@id": "bioconda:rnacode",
  "@type": "schema:SoftwareApplication",
  "schema:citation": "doi:10.1261/rna.2536111",
  "schema:description": "RNAcode - Analyze the protein coding potential in multiple sequence alignments RNAcode relies on evolutionary signatures including synonymous/conservative mutations and conservation of the reading frame. It does not use any species specific sequence characteristics whatsoever and does not use any machine learning techniques.",
